              <calculation class='tableau' formula='//[AVG Daily Vendor Enabled [Current]]]/[AVG Daily Vendor Scanned Barcodes L90D [Current]]]&#10;&#10;IF [Parameters].[Parameter 3] = &apos;Monthly&apos; THEN&#10;AVG({ FIXED [vendor_id], MONTH([date]), [is_enabled_and_active_last_30_days] &gt; 0 : AVG([is_enabled_as_of_date]/[barcodes_scanned_l90d])})&#10;ELSEIF [Parameters].[Parameter 3] = &apos;Weekly&apos; THEN&#10;AVG({ FIXED [vendor_id], WEEK([date]), [is_enabled_and_active_last_30_days] &gt; 0 : AVG([is_enabled_as_of_date]/[barcodes_scanned_l90d])})&#10;ELSEIF [Parameters].[Parameter 3] = &apos;Quarterly&apos; THEN&#10;AVG({ FIXED [vendor_id], QUARTER([date]), [is_enabled_and_active_last_30_days] &gt; 0 : AVG([is_enabled_as_of_date]/[barcodes_scanned_l90d])})&#10;ELSEIF [Parameters].[Parameter 3] = &apos;Yearly&apos; THEN &#10;AVG({ FIXED [vendor_id], YEAR([date]), [is_enabled_and_active_last_30_days] &gt; 0 : AVG([is_enabled_as_of_date]/[barcodes_scanned_l90d])})&#10;ELSE &#10;AVG({ FIXED [vendor_id], [date], [is_enabled_and_active_last_30_days] &gt; 0 : AVG([is_enabled_as_of_date]/[barcodes_scanned_l90d])})&#10;END' />
